{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up, demon! You are trapped in a surreal freak show where space itself wants to destroy you. From above, from the bottomless darkness, giant cubes are inexorably falling - symbols of pure, soulless order, seeking to erase your chaotic essence. Each floor is a new arena for a deadly ballet. Jump, slide, roll - do everything to avoid a fatal blow. Your salvation is in constant movement and searching for the nearest door to the next platform, where only a new round of madness awaits. Save yourself or be crushed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Laugh - 2d platformer with puzzle elements. The player needs to move and jump on falling cubes to climb to inaccessible heights and enter the door to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Responsive Controls</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3912160/5280c0e610fde4d4b260817ee9980491622551dc.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3912160/a3503e4fef4d486fac53108eee52b68d8861afba.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3912160/a0ee7dd77e9fbf0c4d346a6282e5c25764d73db6.jpg"},{"name":"Alive!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3912160/853d5aeee64a23348fa6254e5d9bda289f765881.jpg"},{"name":"Yikes!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3912160/54d2e5bd108239956b46c27ae4e366d73fbc0514.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912160?t=1759940447","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/391